    "html": "<p>Doyle says he first learned of the complaint on September 17, when Anand called him: \"When you called me yesterday, the 17th. I didn't know before.\" <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"marcus\" aria-label=\"Source 1: Marcus Doyle — Subject, Team Supervisor, Member Services — Interview Transcript, lines 83–87\" title=\"Source 1: Marcus Doyle — Subject, Team Supervisor, Member Services — Interview Transcript, lines 83–87\">1</button></p>\n<p>That is the only evidence of when he found out, and it is his own account. The record has no call log, email or notice showing when he was told.</p>\n<p>Goldberg's complaint reached HR on September 15 at 8:12 AM. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"complaint\" aria-label=\"Source 2: 01_Complaint_Email_Goldberg.docx, line 7\" title=\"Source 2: 01_Complaint_Email_Goldberg.docx, line 7\">2</button> The change log shows Doyle removed her from escalations on September 16 at 7:05 AM. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"records\" aria-label=\"Source 3: 07_Exhibit_B_WFM_and_Training_Records.docx, lines 15–21\" title=\"Source 3: 07_Exhibit_B_WFM_and_Training_Records.docx, lines 15–21\">3</button> By his account, he did not know of the complaint when he made that removal.</p>\n<p>Goldberg does not claim he knew. She links the removal to her complaint because it came the day after she went to HR. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"leah\" aria-label=\"Source 4: Leah Goldberg — Complainant, Member Services Representative II — Interview Transcript, line 87\" title=\"Source 4: Leah Goldberg — Complainant, Member Services Representative II — Interview Transcript, line 87\">4</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"leah\" aria-label=\"Source 5: Leah Goldberg — Complainant, Member Services Representative II — Interview Transcript, line 95\" title=\"Source 5: Leah Goldberg — Complainant, Member Services Representative II — Interview Transcript, line 95\">5</button> Rivera said she did not know Goldberg had raised a complaint, which says nothing about Doyle's knowledge. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"carla\" aria-label=\"Source 6: Carla Rivera — Witness — Interview Transcript, line 13\" title=\"Source 6: Carla Rivera — Witness — Interview Transcript, line 13\">6</button></p>\n<p>Nothing in the record independently confirms or contradicts his date.</p>",
