    "html": "<p>The record confirms only three people at the huddle: Goldberg, Doyle, who was going over the rotation, and Kim. Goldberg describes the huddle and Doyle's remark. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"leah\" aria-label=\"Source 1: Leah Goldberg — Complainant, Member Services Representative II — Interview Transcript, line 71\" title=\"Source 1: Leah Goldberg — Complainant, Member Services Representative II — Interview Transcript, line 71\">1</button> Doyle answered questions about it. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"marcus\" aria-label=\"Source 2: Marcus Doyle — Subject, Team Supervisor, Member Services — Interview Transcript, lines 51–55\" title=\"Source 2: Marcus Doyle — Subject, Team Supervisor, Member Services — Interview Transcript, lines 51–55\">2</button> Kim says he was there. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"jordan\" aria-label=\"Source 3: Jordan Kim — Witness, Member Services Representative — Interview Transcript, line 47\" title=\"Source 3: Jordan Kim — Witness, Member Services Representative — Interview Transcript, line 47\">3</button></p>\n<p>Goldberg says \"Someone asked about requests\" and that \"Everyone knew what he meant,\" but she doesn't name anyone. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"leah\" aria-label=\"Source 1: Leah Goldberg — Complainant, Member Services Representative II — Interview Transcript, line 71\" title=\"Source 1: Leah Goldberg — Complainant, Member Services Representative II — Interview Transcript, line 71\">1</button> No attendee list or meeting invite is in the record, and nobody else's presence is stated. Rivera isn't in Doyle's reporting line, and her notes don't say she attended. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"carla\" aria-label=\"Source 4: Carla Rivera — Witness — Interview Transcript, line 5\" title=\"Source 4: Carla Rivera — Witness — Interview Transcript, line 5\">4</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"carla\" aria-label=\"Source 5: Carla Rivera — Witness — Interview Transcript, line 15\" title=\"Source 5: Carla Rivera — Witness — Interview Transcript, line 15\">5</button> Okafor, Tran and Bell are on Doyle's team, but the record doesn't say whether they were at the huddle. <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-number\" data-cite=\"carla\" aria-label=\"Source 6: Carla Rivera — Witness — Interview Transcript, line 9\" title=\"Source 6: Carla Rivera — Witness — Interview Transcript, line 9\">6</button></p>\n<p>To identify the other attendees, you could ask Doyle and Goldberg for names or pull the calendar invite or attendance record for that huddle. Whoever asked about requests is a likely additional witness.</p>",
