    "html": "<p>Subject: Follow-up interview – scheduling</p>\n<p>Dear Marcus,</p>\n<p>Thank you for speaking with Priya Anand on September 18. I would like to schedule a short follow-up interview with you to ask some further questions about the matters you discussed, including how Leah Goldberg's request was handled and the changes to the escalations queue.</p>\n<p>Please let me know which of the following would suit you, or suggest other times that work: [date and time option 1], [date and time option 2], or [date and time option 3]. I expect the conversation to take about [length]. It will take place by [phone / video / in person] and, as before, will be transcribed.</p>\n<p>As a reminder, please keep this matter confidential and do not discuss it with the team. Retaliation against anyone who raised a concern or took part in the investigation is not permitted.</p>\n<p>If you have documents or messages relating to Goldberg's request, the Q4 rotation, or the escalations queue changes, please keep them and bring them to the interview.</p>\n<p>Please reply to confirm a time, or contact me if you have any questions.</p>\n<p>Regards,</p>\n<p>[Investigator name]</p>",
