    "html": "<p>ALLEGATION 4 (reworded): Did Marcus Doyle remove Leah Goldberg from the escalations queue, which carries a pay differential, on September 16, 2026, because she submitted her complaint to HR on September 15, 2026?</p>\n<p>The plan lists only four allegations, so there is no allegation 5. I took you to mean allegation 4, the retaliation allegation, which currently covers both the accommodation request and the HR complaint. The rewording drops the request and keeps only the September 15 complaint. If you meant a new fifth allegation, tell me and I will draft it separately.</p>",
